  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Quintum, qui ex hoc descedat, sit dignus eorum quæ in scripto pacis dicuntur, quod apud Greateleiam institutum est.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Fifthly, he who neglects this shall be liable to those [punishments] which are stated in the statute relating to to the public peace, which was drawn up at Grately.</ab>
      </div>
